DTEND:20260807T210000
DTSTAMP:20260809T161729Z
UID:dfb474755718eb257964ba12c9d2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Fall in Love All Over Again… Join Swamp Meadow Community The
 atre in this colorful retelling of William Shakespeare’s A Midsummer Nig
 ht’s Dream . Love is in the air in Athens\, as well as shenanigans. As f
 our youths enter a mysterious enchanted forest\, the mischievous fairy kin
 g Oberon tasks his servant Puck to brew a love potion for his wife. But th
 ings go awry when the potion is given to the youths\, and all relationship
 s go topsy-turvy! Add in a clueless theatre troop\, whose leader is a donk
 ey\, and you end up with a hilarious yet enchanting time at the theatre! D
 ates August 7 &#8211\; 7 PM August 8 &#8211\; 7 PM August 9 &#8211\; 2 PM 
 General &#8211\; $20 Senior/Student &#8211\; $15 Playing at the Kent Pavil
 lion &#8211\; 1111 Putnam Pike\, Chepachet RI 02814\n\nSource: https://www
 .visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-midsummer-night%e2%80%99s-dream/110735/
LOCATION:Kent Pavillion\, 1111 Putnam Pike\, Chepachet\, RI 02814
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-midsummer-night%e2%80%99s-dre
 am/110735/
END:VEVENT
