UID:99d1f90873431adc45c1169c472b@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Check out Boston's newest club - the Boston Legacy women's soc
 cer club - as they take the field at Centreville Bank Stadium during their
  inaugural season. From exciting matchups to memorable games at the stadiu
 m close to home in RI\, every match is an opportunity to be part of histor
 y as it happens! Check out ticket packages for Rhode Island games: DISCOUN
 TED TICKETS Pride Night Out 401 Edition - You won’t want to miss all the
  excitement of our Ocean State Pride game\, complete with a never--before-
 seen halftime that is sure to leave you wanting more. Come celebrate true 
 community joy with us as we celebrate OUR LGBTQIA+ community. Fans who pur
 chase through this special offer will receive a special Legacy pride item 
 per ticket purchased. SPECIAL TICKET PACKAGE\n\nSource: https://www.visitr
 hodeisland.com/event/boston-legacy-soccer-match-vs-portland-thorns/108573/
LOCATION:Centreville Bank Stadium\, 11 Tidewater Street\, Pawtucket\, RI 0
