DESCRIPTION:Cars &amp\; Coffee When: Select Sundays from 8:00 AM - 10:00 A
 M at Gardner Seveney Sports Complex\, 110-298 Linden Lane\, Portsmouth Jul
 y 5 July 26 August 9 September 20 Cars &amp\; Coffee\, hosted by the Audra
 in Automobile Museum\, has grown exponentially since the start - now eight
  years ago\, only 52 cars appeared at the first event! The Cars &amp\; Cof
 fee family has expanded\, now consistently seeing 350-400 cars on the fiel
 d and more than 1\,000 at the Motor Week event. We feel that Cars &amp\; C
 offee is now the backbone Audrain Automobile Museum and the local car comm
 unity as well. Cheers to another season! Below are a couple reminders for 
 the 2026 Season: For Audrain Members\, registration will open the Monday b
 efore each of the Cars &amp\; Coffee events and public registration will o
 pen on the Wednesday before each of the Cars &amp\; Coffee events. In orde
 r to register for one of the Cars &amp\; Coffee events\, you must be subsc
 ribed to our email list. You cannot register for any of the Cars &amp\; Co
 ffee events through the Audrain website or over the phone. Only Vehicles a
 re required to register for the event. Guests of drivers\, and spectators 
 do not need to register. *All events are subject to change. All events are
  rain or shine unless noted.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/e
 vent/cars-%26-coffee-%e2%80%94-gardner-seveney-sports-complex/110036/
LOCATION:Gardner Seveney Sports Complex\, 110-298 Linden Lane \, Portsmout
 h\, RI 02871 Time: 8:00 AM to 10:00 AM
