 Think Studio 54 glamour\, ABBA-level sparkle\, and queens ready to turn ev
 ery moment into a disco fantasy. Hosted by Boston’s Gigi Glam\, with per
 formances by Kennedy Plaza\, Lucy Diamonds\, and Shania Taint\, this disco
  dream will be packed with camp\, comedy\, and unforgettable performances.
  Your $60 ticket includes: A fabulous 2-course brunch A full drag show spe
 ctacular $10 Drink Specials So grab your dancing queens\, disco divas\, an
